OL,3,GNEWSAVillagers vote on independence
OL,4,Aover asylum plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FVoters in a small village headed to the
OL,7,Fpolls for an independence vote over
OL,8,Fgovernment plans to house asylum
OL,9,Fseekers at a nearby former Ministry of
OL,10,FDefence (MoD) site.
OL,12,FThe residents of Piddington, in
OL,13,FOxfordshire, voted over Home Office
OL,14,Fproposals to house up to 1,256 male
OL,15,Fasylum seekers at MoD Bicester.
OL,17,FThe symbolic referendum on whether to
OL,18,Fleave the UK has been organised by the
OL,19,Flocal parish council, with polling
OL,20,Ftaking place between 07:00 and 19:00
OL,21,FBST.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
